Engineer > Intent: Approved engineering intent
Intent > Reasoning: Task and constraints
Reasoning > Models: Approved model call
Reasoning > Knowledge: Project-scoped context
Reasoning > Control: Proposed action
Control > Execution: Authorized capability
Execution > Git: Scoped engineering action
Execution > CI: Trigger permitted checks
CI > Verification: Deterministic results
Verification > Release: Trusted candidate
Control > Reviewer: Approval when required
Reviewer > Release: Attributable authorization
Release > Registry: Promote exact artifact
Registry > NonProd: Verified deployment
Release > Production: Authorized production deployment
Control > Evidence: Policy and workflow events
Execution > Evidence: Agent and tool events
Verification > Evidence: Test and security evidence
Release > Evidence: Approval and deployment evidence
Evidence > Operator: Audit, telemetry and operations

